+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Texture pool (RSX_TEX_POOL, default on; "0" = one committed resource each)
+ *
+ * CreateCommittedResource is a kernel allocation per texture: 0.5-0.7 ms
+ * each on this driver even for a 144x144 DXT5, and 15-20 ms when the machine
+ * is busy. A fight load creates ~110 textures inside two frames -- most of
+ * the first-fight hitch. Textures are now placed resources in 64 MB heaps;
+ * a released texture's block goes on a free list and the next texture of
+ * the same allocation size takes it (dynamic textures re-create at the same
+ * size every refresh), so the pool does not grow with refreshes.
